---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: "Catering | The Café"
description: "Catering from The Café in Leavenworth, KS: lunch for the office, the crew or the family, ready for pickup or dropped off. Call, email or send a request online."
ogDescription: "Group lunches ready for pickup or dropped off in Leavenworth, KS. Call, email or send a request online."
pageCss: "/assets/css/catering.css"
---
<!-- The menu now has its own page at /menu, built from src/_data/menu.json
             and linked from the nav — the old packages/bundle markup that used to
             sit here is in git history. -->

<!-- Catering is PICKUP OR DROP-OFF (client, 2026-09-29; drop-off added
     2026-10-02): a group lunch ordered ahead, collected at the counter or
     brought to the customer. Anything bigger is worked out in person. This form only collects enough to call
     or email the customer back — the details are settled in that conversation,
     not here. The old full-service fields (event location, service style,
     budget, linen / china / servers checkboxes, a 15-guest minimum) were
     removed on purpose; do not add them back without the client. The notice
     times and payment methods below came from the client the same day. -->

        <section class="section" id="inquiry" aria-labelledby="inquiry-heading">
            <div class="container">
                <h1 id="inquiry-heading">Feeding a crowd?</h1>
                <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem; max-width: 55ch;">
                    Lunch for the office, the crew or the whole family, packed and ready for you to pick up, or dropped off.
                    Send us the basics below and we&rsquo;ll reach out to go over the details.
                </p>

                <div class="call-strip">
                    <p><strong>More than 10 people?</strong> Please give us at least 12 hours&rsquo; notice.
                    Larger custom catering needs a few weeks.</p>
                    <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">We take cash, check or card. Rather talk it through? Call
                    <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a> or email
                    <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Sent by Web3Forms to form@lvcafetogo.com (forwarded to the cafe's
                     Gmail). Field names are what the email shows, so they're written
                     for the reader. With JavaScript, main.js rewrites the subject to
                     carry the name, date, head count and pickup/drop-off, and folds the
                     date and time into one readable "When" line. Every subject contains
                     "Catering request", which the Gmail filter matches: keep it. -->
                     "Catering request", which the Gmail filter matches: keep it. -->
                <form action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST" novalidate
                      data-catering
                      data-success="Thank you! Your catering request is on its way. We'll reach out soon to go over the details.">

                    <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="{{ site.web3forms.catering }}">
                    <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="Catering request: website form">
                    <input type="hidden" name="from_name" value="Catering form">
                    <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="{{ site.web3forms.catering }}">
                    <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="Catering request: website form">
                    <input type="hidden" name="from_name" value="Catering form">
                    <!-- Without JavaScript the browser leaves the page; this brings it
                         back to our /thanks instead of Web3Forms' own. Must be on this
                         domain (the free plan refuses cross-domain redirects). -->
                    <input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="{{ site.url }}/thanks">
                    <!-- honeypot: humans never see or tick this -->
                    <input type="checkbox" name="botcheck" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"
                           style="display: none;" aria-hidden="true">

                    <div class="form-grid">

                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label for="name">Name <span style="color:var(--accent-dark)">*</span></label>
                            <input type="text" id="name" name="Name" autocomplete="name" required placeholder="Jane Smith">
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label for="phone">Phone <span style="color:var(--accent-dark)">*</span></label>
                            <input type="tel" id="phone" name="Phone" autocomplete="tel" required placeholder="(555) 000-0000">
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label for="email">Email <span style="color:var(--accent-dark)">*</span></label>
                            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="jane@example.com">
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label for="org">Company / Organization</label>
                            <input type="text" id="org" name="Organization" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Optional">
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label for="date">Date Needed <span style="color:var(--accent-dark)">*</span></label>
                            <input type="date" id="date" name="Date needed" required>
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label for="time">Time Needed</label>
                            <input type="time" id="time" name="Time needed">
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label for="handoff">Pickup or Drop-off</label>
                            <select id="handoff" name="Pickup or drop-off">
                                <option value="Pickup">Pickup at the cafe</option>
                                <option value="Drop-off">Drop-off (we&rsquo;ll confirm the address)</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label for="people">How Many People <span style="color:var(--accent-dark)">*</span></label>
                            <input type="number" id="people" name="People" min="1" required placeholder="e.g. 12">
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-group form-group--full">
                            <label for="message">What Are You Looking For?</label>
                            <textarea id="message" name="Looking for" placeholder="Sandwiches and a couple of salads, items off our menu, or just tell us what you have in mind. Include any allergies or dietary needs."></textarea>
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-group form-group--full form-submit">
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Send Request</button>
                            <p class="form-privacy" style="margin-top:0.6rem;">
                                We only use your details to respond to this request.
                                See our <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>
        </section>
